00:25:40.031 --> 00:25:42.670
where it's really hard
to compute for example,

00:25:42.671 --> 00:25:45.095
the value of information.

00:25:45.096 --> 00:25:50.540
Applying this to navigating
through a geo database,

00:25:50.541 --> 00:25:51.620
for example, very quickly,

00:25:51.621 --> 00:25:53.380
where you get a sense
by a trajectory

00:25:53.381 --> 00:25:54.680
