00:25:55.986 --> 00:25:57.890
a probability
distribution of needs,

00:25:57.891 --> 00:26:00.075
and potential page
hits and misses,

00:26:00.076 --> 00:26:02.015
or even a gaming engine.

00:26:02.016 --> 00:26:04.210
I'm not in the Cloud

00:26:04.211 --> 00:26:05.355
