this concept here,

00:26:38.521 --> 00:26:41.200
very core notion in systems.

00:26:41.201 --> 00:26:43.760
How do we keep a cache fresh?

00:26:43.761 --> 00:26:48.015
Think about this, or in
the same challenges,

00:26:48.016 --> 00:26:51.865
how do we keep our index
of the web fresh?

00:26:51.866 --> 00:26:53.810
How do we run a web crawl?

00:26:53.811 --> 00:26:56.170
It's a very
interesting problem of

00:26:56.171 --> 00:26:58.870
an agent in the open world,
multiple agents.

00:26:58.871 --> 00:27:00.365
The idea is, you have, let's say,

00:27:00.366 --> 00:27:01.865
if we look at the web problem,

00:27:01.866 --> 00:27:04.690
many pages with some
knowledge about

00:27:04.691 --> 00:27:06.270
