00:27:13.561 --> 00:27:14.830
What's the utility function?

00:27:14.831 --> 00:27:17.170
It's a function of
how all the pages,

00:27:17.171 --> 00:27:20.345
of the cost, and how often
it's been to be looked at.

00:27:20.346 --> 00:27:22.290
Turns out that, to
